<title>PHILIPPINES: Keppel says 1996 net at 111.108 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Keppel says 1996 net at 111.108 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>	  (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    855.982 vs 777.882</p>
<p>    Net income			  111.108 vs 113.184</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  130.195 vs 115.953</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Keppel Philippines Holdings Inc. The company said the increase in revenues was due to higher level of ship repair activities at units Kepphil Shipyard Inc and Cebu Shipyard &amp; Engineering.</p>
</text>
